        "https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/excel/functions/weekday-function: Return-type origins and invalid-mode handling.",
        "Expected serial weekdays use the documented continuous serial cycle including 1900-02-29, not Gregorian conversion. Calc 26.2.6.3 independently corroborates these numeric serial results; this does not identify the same early civil date in Calc and Excel.",
        "Fresh source-hash-bound corroboration: ../evidence/calendar-week-boundaries-libreoffice.json. The Rust excel_date_policy tests cover both date systems, pinned behavior, fractional days, errors and every ISO boundary family."
